    ("How many days a week do I need to come to the office?", "Three days per week as per your team roster. Tuesday to Thursday are the anchor days. Some groups (new joiners in their first 90 days, people serving notice, trainees and Care Centre shift staff) work from office every working day.", "ZEN-POL-002"),
